    "body": "Universal critical ASH* remains open for stacking and clearing. S009 completes the owner-directed foundational primary-source/dependency comparison and cold S008 challenge, then develops exact tools for the unresolved global extremal comparison.\n\nThe research records first-return ancestry messages with consuming boundary excursions, exact marked insertion/deletion frontiers, a three-component reconstruction obstruction, and legal path-cover/protected-triangle bounds for graphs with a universal vertex. Known source mechanisms and lower bounds are credited; possible originality and inaccessible original-proof equivalences remain qualified.\n\nValidation: 15 inherited check-only commands; all S003-S008 manifests with prescribed frozen indexes; 318 registered port cases with complete independent closures/reverse rooted membership; 3,860 full upper-layer traces and 795 protected ancestry repairs checked against 33 complete reverse layers. Local governance and staged whitespace checks pass. Failed implementation/comparison attempts are retained and repaired; all old cutoffs remain unchanged.\n\nUniversal Phase1 remains IN_PROGRESS. No Lean, publication, registration or correspondence. All current mirrors and immutable hashes updated; complete S010 prompt is strictly FUTURE/UNEXECUTED and copied verbatim into closeout. This PR contains one atomic authored S009 commit; actual integration identifiers and hosted jobs will be recorded in PR metadata after verification.\n",
